{
  "authority_effect": "NONE",
  "evidence_effect": "NONE",
  "chapter": 86,
  "title": "潇湘馆泪尽芳魂逝　痴公子来迟旧梦空",
  "title_status": "TG工作回目",
  "source": {
    "path": "sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md",
    "sha256": "cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c",
    "lines": [
      401,
      459
    ],
    "byte_range": [
      15294,
      18084
    ],
    "text_sha256": "87eb7940caece3c0a905d46c35e36b692ccf0f32921662e2640e580ef010d8cc"
  },
  "card_fields": [
    {
      "number": 1,
      "name": "硬节点",
      "text": "**1｜硬节点**  \nR10/R11；死亡方式必须是长期病程终点。当前“宝玉来迟”是C级章法，不伪装硬证。\n\n",
      "citation": {
        "path": "sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md",
        "sha256": "cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c",
        "lines": [
          406,
          408
        ],
        "byte_range": [
          15442,
          15574
        ],
        "text_sha256": "ba579384b0678013d16620ec834d82d7b5808820069a6e71847930743ba19c2b"
      }
    },
    {
      "number": 2,
      "name": "最强处 / 最高P-Lock",
      "text": "**2｜最强处 / 最高P-Lock**  \n最后一个普通病日；火箸碰茶盘；米汤、药、热水、炉火；G01改字未成；大夫有现实延误；宝玉赶到只问“药还没吃么？再温一温”；末尾**冷药无人再温**。\n\n",
      "citation": {
        "path": "sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md",
        "sha256": "cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c",
        "lines": [
          409,
          411
        ],
        "byte_range": [
          15574,
          15819
        ],
        "text_sha256": "6294a4b92d26277a59da7e8bc02363262507446bc5fe5720ddeb32b03006fb46"
      }
    },
    {
      "number": 3,
      "name": "最薄处",
      "text": "**3｜最薄处**  \n死亡前后“身体—信息—后事”三个转换还需精确校时；宝玉来迟必须由信息链而非人为阻拦成立。\n\n",
      "citation": {
        "path": "sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md",
        "sha256": "cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c",
        "lines": [
          412,
          414
        ],
        "byte_range": [
          15819,
          15973
        ],
        "text_sha256": "e34ce345aab8ce8482fb7b5f85e293931a8b3995005ad570602acbb4a69621e0"
      }
    },
    {
      "number": 4,
      "name": "缺失情节",
      "text": "**4｜缺失情节**  \n按35冻结六段：明日安排 → 医者迟 → 最后未成文人动作 → 身体不可逆 → 死后先处理身体/热水衣物 → 宝玉迟到 → 后事第一轮。\n\n",
      "citation": {
        "path": "sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md",
        "sha256": "cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c",
        "lines": [
          415,
          417
        ],
        "byte_range": [
          15973,
          16172
        ],
        "text_sha256": "c8442b0289c134a0b8a563cf0f2b30ce93f402e6064b68bb05aeb4552739a40e"
      }
    },
    {
      "number": 5,
      "name": "人物",
      "text": "**5｜人物**  \n紫鹃、雪雁、李纨、宝钗、王夫人、医者、跑腿、宝玉。不得全家轮流说遗言。\n\n",
      "citation": {
        "path": "sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md",
        "sha256": "cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c",
        "lines": [
          418,
          420
        ],
        "byte_range": [
          16172,
          16296
        ],
        "text_sha256": "2ea29c21f3bfc61e731799ba8a2de49a66c33b53c83f609f633d211a77f0d584"
      }
    },
    {
      "number": 6,
      "name": "文化",
      "text": "**6｜文化**  \n旧集/稿夹只服务临终生活；不做遗稿展览。\n\n",
      "citation": {
        "path": "sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md",
        "sha256": "cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c",
        "lines": [
          421,
          423
        ],
        "byte_range": [
          16296,
          16373
        ],
        "text_sha256": "48b07313ff0a07cfdace8f9414beb70a6d9286b8fd7c2b6540f1f4c9e89f8b4f"
      }
    },
    {
      "number": 7,
      "name": "诗文身份",
      "text": "**7｜诗文身份**  \nG01“小院苔痕留宿雨 / 隔帘花影 □ 新晴”永不补完。A01应已在85完成。C01《葬花吟》只由死亡事实兑现第一层；C02《芙蓉女儿诔》读者暗回声；C06“冷月葬花魂”不明引；无《黛玉诔》、无作者挽诗。\n\n",
      "citation": {
        "path": "sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md",
        "sha256": "cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c",
        "lines": [
          424,
          426
        ],
        "byte_range": [
          16373,
          16663
        ],
        "text_sha256": "649e3bac7648c718a84c1c4362adb1d04d83e73cb986c630cd10531e175331d3"
      }
    },
    {
      "number": 8,
      "name": "笑料",
      "text": "**8｜笑料**  \n病晨仍可有一两句小丫头/米汤口角；死亡后立即退。\n\n",
      "citation": {
        "path": "sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md",
        "sha256": "cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c",
        "lines": [
          427,
          429
        ],
        "byte_range": [
          16663,
          16752
        ],
        "text_sha256": "064346ed111e36b35f22d852a99262c53086a8d096b8e9d4bbcebc800d5dc39e"
      }
    },
    {
      "number": 9,
      "name": "宗教/梦",
      "text": "**9｜宗教/梦**  \n不临终悟道、不托梦、不写冷月显灵。形而上只在旧作暗回声。\n\n",
      "citation": {
        "path": "sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md",
        "sha256": "cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c",
        "lines": [
          430,
          432
        ],
        "byte_range": [
          16752,
          16859
        ],
        "text_sha256": "a8005e17d65f111ad5300ff6f9b3dc230b02dd81f04d471497f79130b4fc9ca5"
      }
    },
    {
      "number": 10,
      "name": "职业",
      "text": "**10｜职业**  \n大夫“迟”必须有普通现实原因；药铺、跑腿、厨房、热水构成真正医疗劳务。\n\n",
      "citation": {
        "path": "sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md",
        "sha256": "cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c",
        "lines": [
          433,
          435
        ],
        "byte_range": [
          16859,
          16984
        ],
        "text_sha256": "ab0529d9bc6e3b749aaa00e7e393dbbd35f8427810bd84eaf0921f24ffd94bfa"
      }
    },
    {
      "number": 11,
      "name": "四链",
      "text": "**11｜四链**  \n人：照护链必须持续；钱：仍非穷死；物：药、米汤、炉、衣、热水、旧稿；信：病危→雪雁/人去报→宝玉迟获消息→赶来。\n\n",
      "citation": {
        "path": "sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md",
        "sha256": "cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c",
        "lines": [
          436,
          438
        ],
        "byte_range": [
          16984,
          17170
        ],
        "text_sha256": "35c6a9a0cdd9c2ba9f86db12541717d70b9d68b1e86bd65d6a9c6e1f024dcd09"
      }
    },
    {
      "number": 12,
      "name": "必须保留",
      "text": "**12｜必须保留**  \n“再温一温”、未成稿、药吊子、紫鹃不翻稿、炉火熄、冷药结尾。\n\n",
      "citation": {
        "path": "sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md",
        "sha256": "cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c",
        "lines": [
          439,
          441
        ],
        "byte_range": [
          17170,
          17286
        ],
        "text_sha256": "6d15feb53097e6205fe066b2c72adcdc0766ade8d867826e11f4f329e94c9ec9"
      }
    },
    {
      "number": 13,
      "name": "应删",
      "text": "**13｜应删**  \n任何死亡后长篇哭诉、遗言、绝命诗、作者评叹；任何“因为宝玉结婚/失玉所以死”的单因果。\n\n",
      "citation": {
        "path": "sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md",
        "sha256": "cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c",
        "lines": [
          442,
          444
        ],
        "byte_range": [
          17286,
          17433
        ],
        "text_sha256": "ce0fb459938c863d8d51711a9daa666372f309271941913db29597c3e6367ae3"
      }
    },
    {
      "number": 14,
      "name": "L3候选",
      "text": "**14｜L3候选**  \n本回正式重排为五段压力结构，属于L3。\n\n",
      "citation": {
        "path": "sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md",
        "sha256": "cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c",
        "lines": [
          445,
          447
        ],
        "byte_range": [
          17433,
          17508
        ],
        "text_sha256": "5b125ed24cde40f0f54050621e04df191a47b8afaf428648b3018888fd44c266"
      }
    },
    {
      "number": 15,
      "name": "前80同构",
      "text": "**15｜前80同构**  \n晴雯死、秦可卿丧务的“身体与家务并行”，但黛玉必须有自己长期病史。\n\n",
      "citation": {
        "path": "sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md",
        "sha256": "cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c",
        "lines": [
          448,
          450
        ],
        "byte_range": [
          17508,
          17632
        ],
        "text_sha256": "f3799d512c03a4a5a4f316d669843ec7828a1ce222f5302538bf7fa5221d621d"
      }
    },
    {
      "number": 16,
      "name": "回前诗",
      "text": "**16｜回前诗** 无。  \n",
      "citation": {
        "path": "sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md",
        "sha256": "cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c",
        "lines": [
          451,
          451
        ],
        "byte_range": [
          17632,
          17660
        ],
        "text_sha256": "e1c22a397f53f3d123997c31bccf5dc898e2eee9267dc54c723ff51c44ba4ad3"
      }
    },
    {
      "number": 17,
      "name": "回末诗",
      "text": "**17｜回末诗** **强锁无诗**。\n\n",
      "citation": {
        "path": "sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md",
        "sha256": "cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c",
        "lines": [
          452,
          453
        ],
        "byte_range": [
          17660,
          17700
        ],
        "text_sha256": "44e50474767c8d9301ed3c5c77ae2942e439a0cef17b919c728501c816f9af53"
      }
    },
    {
      "number": 18,
      "name": "最终章法 / 风险",
      "text": "**18｜最终章法 / 风险**  \n普通晨间 → 尚做明日打算 → G01改字 → 身体跨界 → 信息外传/医生迟 → 死亡与身体料理 → 宝玉来迟 → 冷药。  \n**压力测试问题：**能否在不增加哭喊强度的情况下，使“来迟”更痛；能否让死亡真实而不医学化；A01是否在85已经足够，让86不再背诗文任务。\n\n",
      "citation": {
        "path": "sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md",
        "sha256": "cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c",
        "lines": [
          454,
          457
        ],
        "byte_range": [
          17700,
          18079
        ],
        "text_sha256": "ca835b9c0cc0faa57e527da203559a9747367ae96a4fd542615428deec253849"
      }
    }
  ],
